---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Shield, Cpu, Lock, Zap, CheckCircle2, Server, Globe } from 'lucide-react';
---

<Layout
  title="About NovaTools - Privacy-First Media Architecture"
  description="Learn about NovaTools, our mission to eliminate privacy risks in online file conversions, and our WebAssembly client-side runtime."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-12">
    {/* Page Header */}
    <div class="space-y-4 text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-500/10 px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-emerald-400">
        <Shield class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />
        <span>Our Engineering Philosophy</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white">
        Re-inventing Document & Media Tools for Privacy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-zinc-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        We believe you should never have to upload your confidential financial records, medical PDFs, personal family photos, or proprietary videos to an unknown remote server just to merge or compress them.
      </p>
    </div>

    {/* Mission & Problem Statement */}
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-surface-border bg-surface p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-3">
        <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-red-500/10 text-red-400 border border-red-500/20">
          <Server class="h-5 w-5" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-white">The Cloud Utility Problem</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
          Traditional online file converters force users to upload their documents to centralized servers. 
          Even when companies promise deletion, your private data travels across networks, sits on temporary disk storage, and risks exposure to data breaches and insider threats.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-surface-border bg-surface p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-3">
        <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/20">
          <Cpu class="h-5 w-5" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-white">The NovaTools Solution</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
          NovaTools executes 100% of its workloads directly inside your browser sandbox. 
          By utilizing modern <strong>WebAssembly (WASM)</strong>, HTML5 Canvas, and Web Workers, your device’s own CPU and GPU process your files locally at hardware speeds.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* Technical Core Pillars */}
    <section class="rounded-2xl border border-surface-border bg-surface p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Our Core Engineering Principles</h2>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-brand-500/10 text-brand-400 border border-brand-500/20">
            <Lock class="h-4 w-4" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-200">Zero Server Transmission</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-zinc-400 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed">
              When you drop a file into NovaTools, it is read into JavaScript TypedArrays (ArrayBuffers) in your local RAM. No API requests containing your file data are ever transmitted.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/20">
            <Zap class="h-4 w-4" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-200">Zero Queue & Instant Speed</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-zinc-400 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed">
              Cloud tools place you in processing queues with artificial speed limits. NovaTools utilizes multi-threaded client execution to process documents in milliseconds.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <div class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-400 border border-indigo-500/20">
            <Globe class="h-4 w-4" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-200">Unlimited & Free Access</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-zinc-400 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed">
              Because computations run on the client rather than expensive cloud servers, NovaTools does not charge subscription fees or throttle large file sizes.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {/* Contact CTA */}
    <div class="text-center pt-4">
      <p class="text-xs text-zinc-400">
        Have questions, feedback, or enterprise inquiries?{' '}
        <a href="/contact" class="text-brand-400 hover:underline">Get in touch with our team</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
